ittaketosendaparceltoslovakia-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-howlongdoesittaketosendaparceltoslovakia" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-howlongdoesittaketosendaparceltoslovakia" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-How long does it take to send a parcel to Slovakia?-open answer" data-test-id="howlongdoesittaketosendaparceltoslovakia-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="howlongdoesittaketosendaparceltoslovakia-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>How long does it take to send a parcel to Slovakia?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-howlongdoesittaketosendaparceltoslovakia" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-howlongdoesittaketosendaparceltoslovakia" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="howlongdoesittaketosendaparceltoslovakia-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->A parcel to Slovakia once dropped off at a ParcelShop or Locker should take around 8-11 days to arrive at its destination.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="isthereanimporttaxfromtheuktoslovakia-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-isthereanimporttaxfromtheuktoslovakia" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-isthereanimporttaxfromtheuktoslovakia" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Is there an import tax from the UK to Slovakia?-open answer" data-test-id="isthereanimporttaxfromtheuktoslovakia-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="isthereanimporttaxfromtheuktoslovakia-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Is there an import tax from the UK to Slovakia?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-isthereanimporttaxfromtheuktoslovakia" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-isthereanimporttaxfromtheuktoslovakia" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="isthereanimporttaxfromtheuktoslovakia-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->When sending parcels to Slovakia, you may need to pay customs fees and VAT. The amount can depend on the destination, purpose, and value of your parcel.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If your recipient needs to pay customs duty, remember to let them know. We’ll contact your recipient via email and share a secure payment link to clear customs before they can receive their items.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Check out our simple guide on <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/guides/how-to-send-an-international-parcel" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->how to send an international parcel<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> for more information. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="canitrackmyparcelstoslovakia-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-canitrackmyparcelstoslovakia" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-canitrackmyparcelstoslovakia" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Can I track my parcels to Slovakia?-open answer" data-test-id="canitrackmyparcelstoslovakia-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="canitrackmyparcelstoslovakia-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Can I track my parcels to Slovakia?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.